    "body": "In general the notes are not going to be comprehensive. If you need to find out the actual definition used, you need to read the normative spec text. The summary notes are just a summary, and will use imprecise terms like \"resource\" or \"parsing\" or \"loading\" without defining them.\r\n\r\nLet me close this, as it's out of scope to define all terms in the non-normative documentation notes. But happy to continue helping clarify in the closed thread, and reopen if we missed something.",
